qa:ATM-QA-AG19-002
    a qa:Finding ;
    qa:findingId "ATM-QA-AG19-002" ;
    qa:phase "phase-AG" ;
    qa:title "Reply-only finalize/plan-build stack survives, duplicating canonical send path" ;
    qa:severity "blocking" ;
    qa:pattern "duplicated-finalize-stack", "entangled-with-AG18-QA-002" ;
    qa:repeatable false ;
    qa:repeatableNote "Specific to this stack (ack/mod.rs finalize/reply-plan functions), but structurally the same rename-not-remove/duplicate-path shape documented at the phase level." ;
    qa:sourceReviewers "req-qa (ARCH-AG19-002)", "arch-qa (ARCH-AG19-002)", "ruthless-boundary-qa (RBQA-F002)" ;
    qa:description """crates/atm-core/src/ack/mod.rs still defines the full reply-only finalize/plan-build stack -- FinalizeAckContext (struct, ~line 300), finalize_sent_ack_outcome (~line 598), build_reply_delivery_plan (~line 697), and reply_post_send_messages (~line 722) -- unchanged from AG.18 through AG.19, AG.20, and the in-progress AG.21. This duplicates the canonical plan-build/execute path already established in crates/atm-core/src/send/outcome.rs (build_send_delivery_plan at ~line 118, execute_delivery_plan re-exported at ~line 5, used together at outcome.rs:55-56). docs/plans/phase-AG/sprint-AG19.md names this reply-only stack for deletion; instead it survives in full, including its own delivery-plan-building and post-send-message logic that duplicates send/outcome.rs's canonical functions. Fix: collapse ack/mod.rs's finalize_sent_ack_outcome / build_reply_delivery_plan / reply_post_send_messages into direct reuse of send/outcome.rs's build_send_delivery_plan and execute_delivery_plan, removing the parallel reply-only stack.""" ;
    qa:entanglement qa:AG18-QA-002 ;
    qa:entanglementNote """This finding cannot be judged closed independent of AG18-QA-002 (SendResponseEnvelope::{Sent,Acknowledged} never deleted/deprecated, also blocking, also open through AG.21). The finalize stack here round-trips through SendResponseEnvelope via crate::boundary::RemoteSendDeliveryOutcome::Delivered(Box<crate::protocol::ResponseEnvelope>) wrapping SendResponseEnvelope::Sent(...)/Acknowledged(...) at ack/mod.rs lines ~681, ~1026-1028, ~1130-1132. Deleting/collapsing the finalize/plan-build stack without also collapsing the Sent/Acknowledged split leaves a dangling or awkwardly-adapted envelope shape; collapsing the envelope split without also removing the reply-only finalize stack leaves the duplicate plan-build path intact under a renamed envelope. These two findings must be fixed together, on the same branch, in the same fix pass.""" ;
    qa:sweepScope "feature/pAG-s19-delete-remote-ack-path and dependents (AG.20, AG.21); re-sweep AG.22-25 once real commits land" .

